%U A365118 95244997612,375469654543,1484519159122,5885302251250,23389997790804,93172394487012
%N A365118 G.f. satisfies A(x) = (1 + x / (1 - x*A(x)))^2.
%F A365118 If g.f. satisfies A(x) = (1 + x/(1 - x*A(x))^s)^t, then a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} binomial(t*(n-k+1),k) * binomial(n+(s-1)*k-1,n-k)/(n-k+1).
%F A365118 G.f.: A(x) = (1 + x*B(x))^2 where B(x) is the g.f. of A161634. - _Seiichi Manyama_, Dec 09 2024
%F A365118 D-finite with recurrence -6*(n+1)*(2*n-1)*a(n) +2*(10*n^2-7*n+3)*a(n-1) +8*(13*n^2-34*n+18)*a(n-2) +(101*n-149)*(n-3)*a(n-3) +23*(n-3)*(n-4)*a(n-4)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%F A365118 D-finite with recurrence 2*(2*n-1)*(19*n-42)*(n+1)*a(n) +4*(-38*n^3+122*n^2-89*n+21)*a(n-1) -4*(n-2)*(152*n^2-412*n+207)*a(n-2) -23*(n-2)*(n-3)*(19*n-23)*a(n-3)=0. - _R. J. Mathar_, Nov 02 2026
%o A365118 (PARI) a(n, s=1, t=2) = sum(k=0, n, binomial(t*(n-k+1), k)*binomial(n+(s-1)*k-1, n-k)/(n-k+1));
